  "description": "Real ArduCopter DataFlash logs and one manufacturer bench table that their owners posted publicly on the ArduPilot forum while asking for help. The files are not in the repository: they are too large for git, and nobody granted a license. They are kept outside every checkout and passed to the analysis scripts with --input PATH --sha256 HEX; this file holds each file's SHA-256, size and source. Adopted for TASK-116, TASK-117, TASK-145 and TASK-184 by the stakeholder's decision of 2026-11-07 ('Use the parts that hold up'), after a review that found the logs genuine and several claims of the list that pointed to them wrong (no rangefinder, radar altimeter or ESC telemetry in any log). A second list of 2026-11-07 (ardupilot-forum-datasets-v2.md) added the 5-inch quad of topic 145352 with a rangefinder and motor speeds, the 18 kg quad of topic 96944 and two more logs of topic 140620; its other claims checked wrong are noted with their aircraft.",
